Recommended MVP

For your NestJS + Prisma + PostgreSQL project, I wouldn't build all 25 modules initially.

I'd start with these 10 core modules:

01. Auth & RBAC
02. Organization & Branch
03. Customer
04. KYC
05. Loan Product
06. Loan Application
07. Loan Approval
08. Loan Disbursement
09. Loan Repayment
10. Reporting

Then Phase 2:

11. Collection
12. Delinquency
13. Savings
14. Cash/Teller
15. Accounting/GL
16. Collateral
17. Guarantor
18. Notifications
19. Document Management
20. Audit & Compliance


